    "/v1/keys/{key_id}/techniques": {
      "get": {
        "tags": [
          "Keak Code"
        ],
        "summary": "Read the calling key's technique profile",
        "operationId": "getKeyTechniqueProfile",
        "description": "What each Cheaper Inference technique will do for requests made with this key, derived from the same resolver that serves requests: the key's own override, the workspace setting, the effective state and where it comes from. Also the key's id, prefix, scopes, monthly spend limit and `prompt_cache_mode`. On a workspace key also the workspace admin policy (`admin_policy`): a technique it locks off reads `locked_by_workspace: true` and `effective: false`, and `prompt_cache_mode_effective` applies its cache rule. Requires the `inference` scope. Only `self` is accepted as `key_id` in this release.",
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          },
          {
            "AnthropicApiKey": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "key_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "`self`: the API key making the request. Any other value is a 404 in this release.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "self"
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/KeyTechniqueProfile"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Malformed request (`type: invalid_request_error`, `code: invalid_request`)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Invalid or missing API key (`type: authentication_error`, `code: invalid_api_key`)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "402": {
            "description": "Insufficient wallet balance (`type: invalid_request_error`, `code: insufficient_balance`)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "`code: insufficient_scope` when the key lacks `inference` (`param` is the scope). `code: api_key_required` for a caller with no API key behind it.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "`code: api_key_not_found`: `key_id` is not `self`, or the key was revoked after it authenticated.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "408": {
            "description": "Request timed out (`type: invalid_request_error`, `code: request_failed`)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "`code: delegated_api_key`: a temporary Prompt Studio key authenticates as its parent, so `self` would describe another key. Use the selected API key instead.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "413": {
            "description": "Request too large (`type: invalid_request_error`, `code: request_too_large`)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "422": {
            "description": "A parameter failed validation (`type: invalid_request_error`, `code: invalid_request`)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "425": {
            "description": "Too early (`type: invalid_request_error`, `code: request_failed`)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "429": {
            "description": "Rate limited (`type: rate_limit_error`, `code: rate_limit_exceeded`)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "500": {
            "description": "Server error (`type: api_error`, `code: server_error`)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "502": {
            "description": "The upstream provider returned an unusable response (`type: api_error`, `code: upstream_error`)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "503": {
            "description": "`code: technique_settings_unavailable`: the profile could not be read. Retry shortly.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "504": {
            "description": "Upstream timeout (`type: api_error`, `code: upstream_timeout`)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "put": {
        "tags": [
          "Keak Code"
        ],
        "summary": "Narrow the calling key's technique profile",
        "operationId": "updateKeyTechniqueProfile",
        "description": "Move the key's own techniques toward conservative and set its prompt-cache default. `profile: \"coding-safe-v1\"` writes an explicit off override for every implemented technique; entries in `techniques` then apply on top of it. `off` is always allowed; `inherit` only while the workspace has that technique off; `on` never (403 `technique_change_requires_manager`, turned on by the key's manager in the dashboard). Unknown fields are refused. Requires the `inference` scope. Only `self` is accepted as `key_id`. Answers with the profile read back after the change. Under a workspace `prompt_cache_rule`, `prompt_cache_mode` is still stored as the key's default and the answer is 200: `prompt_cache_mode` shows it and `prompt_cache_mode_effective` the rule. `inherit` on a technique the workspace locks off is refused like any `inherit` while the workspace has it on, because it would turn on when the lock is lifted.",
        "security": [
          {
            "BearerAuth": []
          },
          {
            "AnthropicApiKey": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "key_id",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "`self`: the API key making the request. Any other value is a 404 in this release.",
            "schema": {
              "type": "string",
              "enum": [
                "self"
              ]
            }
          }
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/KeyTechniqueProfileUpdate"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "Successful response",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/KeyTechniqueProfile"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "Malformed body (`code: invalid_request`): not a JSON object, empty, an unknown field, an unknown technique id, a state other than on/off/inherit, or a `prompt_cache_mode` other than on/off/passthrough. `param` names the field, for example `techniques.<id>`.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "Invalid or missing API key (`type: authentication_error`, `code: invalid_api_key`)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "402": {
            "description": "Insufficient wallet balance (`type: invalid_request_error`, `code: insufficient_balance`)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "403": {
            "description": "`code: insufficient_scope` when the key lacks `inference` (`param` is the scope). `code: api_key_required` for a caller with no API key behind it. `code: technique_change_requires_manager` (`param: techniques.<id>`) for `on`, or for `inherit` while the workspace has that technique on, because either would turn it on for this key. `code: api_key_not_manageable` when the caller cannot manage the key. Nothing is written on any 403.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "404": {
            "description": "`code: api_key_not_found`: `key_id` is not `self`, or the key was revoked after it authenticated.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "408": {
            "description": "Request timed out (`type: invalid_request_error`, `code: request_failed`)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "409": {
            "description": "`code: delegated_api_key`: a temporary Prompt Studio key authenticates as its parent, so `self` would describe another key. Use the selected API key instead.",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "413": {
            "description": "Request too large (`type: invalid_request_error`, `code: request_too_large`)",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OpenAIError"
                }
              }
            }
          },
